
wc filename  --> to know no of lines, words, bytes in file
wc -l filename  --> lines
wc -w filename  --> words
wc -m file      --> Characters
wc -c filename  --> bytes

ls -l | wc -l   --> no of files & directories (1 less)

ls -l | grep "drwx*" | wc -l   --> no of dirctores

grep word filename | wc -l   --> no of lines contains word

